  "claim": "The famous opera comique that was based on a mid-century Prosper Merimee novella, in which Nell Rankin was particularly admired for her performance in the title role, perhaps the most famous \"opéra comique\", is a tragedy not a comedy.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Opéra comique. Sentence: Associated with the Paris theatre of the same name, \"opéra comique\" is not always comic or light in nature; \"Carmen\", perhaps the most famous \"opéra comique\", is a tragedy.\nPage: Carmen. Sentence: Carmen (] ; ] ) is an opera in four acts by French composer Georges Bizet.\nPage: Carmen. Sentence: The libretto was written by Henri Meilhac and Ludovic Halévy, based on a novella of the same title by Prosper Mérimée.\nPage: Nell Rankin. Sentence: She was particularly admired for her portrayals of Amneris in Verdi's \"Aida\" and the title role in Bizet's \"Carmen\". \"",
